    "title": "Recap: Dodgers Complete Sweep Of Rockies With Extra Innings Victory - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Blake Williams ,\n6 minutes ago The Los Angeles Dodgers completed a three-game sweep against the Colorado Rockies for the second time this season after going to extra innings. They previously swept the Rox on May 25-27 at Dodger Stadium, and it was the ninth sweep of their season. The Dodgers’ last three-game sweep at Coors Field was June 24-26, 2025. Read full article",
